export anchor DarkMonoMinimalStyle:
    number: 264
    screen: CloudFiles
    name: Dark mono minimal
    idea: Black, white and greys only, with wide margins, hairline rules and thin type, so the files read like a quiet gallery list.
    base: dark
    palette:
        black: #0a0a0a, page, panels and the style sheet
        raise: #161616, the selected row
        ink: #f2f2f2, text and headings
        muted: #a3a3a3, meta, labels, file icons and inactive nav
        line: #2a2a2a, hairline rules and meter tracks
        strong: #6b6b6b, control outlines and field underlines
        white: #ffffff, the primary button, current markers, meters, status icons and focus
    type:
        One system stack, system-ui, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica Neue,
        Arial. Base 15px at 1.6. The folder title is 44px at weight 250,
        the details title 20px at 400, file names 15px, meta 13.5 to 14px
        in muted grey, and column heads and panel labels 12px caps tracked
        0.1em.
    layout:
        A thin header holds the Brightwork Drive wordmark, an underline
        only Search files field and a round MO initials outline. Below it
        three columns sit inside 56px margins. A 200px text nav lists the
        five places with grey icons, My files current with a 1px white
        left bar, then 64.2 GB of 100 GB used with a 2px white meter and
        35.8 GB free. The middle column has the breadcrumb, the light 44px
        title, a white Upload button, an outlined New folder button and a
        List or Grid text switch with List underlined in white. Files are
        unboxed rows on hairlines with name, modified date over the person,
        and size. Status words follow the name. The upload shows as a 1px
        white line along the row foot. A 300px details column shows a
        square outlined preview, the name, facts as a two column list, a
        white Share button, an outlined Download button and an underlined
        Get link text button. Below 1180px details move under the list.
        Below 760px the nav scrolls sideways and rows put meta under names.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 56px page margins and column gaps, 18px row padding, 40px between blocks.
    density: Airy. About eight rows fill a laptop screen and nothing is boxed.
    corners: Square everywhere except the round initials.
    borders: 1px #2a2a2a hairlines under rows and the header. Controls use 1px #6b6b6b.
    shadows: None. The selected row is one step lighter with a 2px white inner left edge.
    icons:
        Line icons at 1.75 stroke, 18px, in grey. Starred uses a filled
        star, Shared with 4 people two heads, Uploading 62% an up arrow in
        a ring, each in white beside the word.
    focus: A 2px solid white outline with a 3px offset.
    tone: Spare and literal, such as Upload, 64.2 GB of 100 GB used and 35.8 GB free.
